  "graphicNotes": [
    "Large flat court is intentional negative space, not an invitation to repeat memorial props.",
    "Use a broad rough rock vault; a restrained stone plinth and small temple-work traces may anchor the site, but do not invent another full temple or palace.",
    "Keep firing ramp left of bell body (bell x range 6220–7200); no bridge or solid route through bronze.",
    "Put wear, bronze relief and a few oil lamps on actual existing vector assets. No glowing runes or neon effects."
  ],
  "combatTradeoffs": [
    "Best party and objective readability; simplest all-class ground traversal.",
    "Open court exposes the party to longer firing lanes.",
    "Fewer vertical choices; gallery shape and spacing must still block trivial all-map sightlines."
  ],
